    *   Week 1 Content: Usually, the first lesson in the new Grade 8 curriculum (based on common textbooks like *Kết nối tri thức* or *Chân trời sáng tạo*) focuses on "Tự hào về truyền thống dân tộc" (Pride in National Traditions) or similar themes related to self-awareness and national values.
